     1291       apply "ctrl-e":U to invngbeg in frame Dialog-Frame .
     1292     END.
     1293     ON CHOOSE OF MENU-ITEM m-ed-date8-4 in menu m-ed-date8 DO:
     1294       apply "ctrl-f":U to invngbeg in frame Dialog-Frame .
     1295     END.
